            "title": "Can my baby wear a sleeper under the sleep bag?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes \u2014 most parents do. A fitted TENCEL\u2122 sleeper under a 1.0 TOG bag is the most common combo. Avoid too many layers: one more layer than an adult would wear is a good rule of thumb.</p>"
