          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the difference between TENCEL, Muslin, and Waffle Knit?",
            "answer": "<p>TENCEL\u2122 Modal is the softest and most temperature-regulating \u2014 great year-round. Bamboo Muslin is ultra-lightweight and breathable, ideal for warm weather (0.5 TOG). Waffle Knit provides gentle insulation with built-in airflow \u2014 perfect for the 2.5 TOG winter option.</p>"
          }
        },
