          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are sleep bags good for babies with eczema?",
            "answer": "<p>Many parents tell us yes. TENCEL's smooth fibre surface creates less friction against skin, and there are no flame-retardant chemicals on any of our fabrics. Talk to your paediatrician for your child's specific situation.</p>"
          }
